#Mission Info

$Version: 0.10
$Name:  XSTR("Hammer and Anvil", -1)
$Author: Claude (extra missions for the Diaspora port)
$Created: 11/02/26 at 12:00:00
$Modified: 11/02/26 at 12:00:00
$Notes:
Generated by tools/make_extra_missions.py (non-commercial, CC BY-NC-SA with the Diaspora content).
$End Notes:

$Mission Desc:
 XSTR("[[Duration: ~12 min | Difficulty: Hard]] Raptor recon caught six Cylon Heavy Raiders massing at the edge of the Ilion system, loaded for a strike on the fleet. The frigate Halyard will jump into their path as the anvil, Red and Blue flights are the hammer. Kill the Heavy Raiders before they jump away.", -1)
$end_multi_text

